<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Import newsletter — Administration</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; background: #f4efe6; margin: 0; padding: 2rem; color: #2a2a2a; }
        .wrap { max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; }
        .card { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e0d3bd; border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
        h1 { color: #1f4f7a; font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 0; }
        a.back { color: #1f4f7a; text-decoration: none; font-size: .9rem; }
        input[type=file] { display: block; margin: 1rem 0; }
        button { background: #1f4f7a; color: #fff; border: 0; border-radius: 8px; padding: .7rem 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; }
        .flash { padding: .8rem 1rem; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
        .flash.success { background: #e8f5e9; border: 1px solid #a5d6a7; color: #2e7d32; }
        .flash.danger { background: #fdecec; border: 1px solid #f5c2c2; color: #b02a2a; }
        code { background: #f4efe6; padding: .1rem .3rem; border-radius: 4px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
    <a class="back" href="/admin">← Retour au tableau de bord</a>
    <div class="card">
        <h1>Importer des abonnés (CSV)</h1>
        {% for type, messages in app.flashes %}
            {% for message in messages %}
                <div class="flash {{ type }}">{{ message }}</div>
            {% endfor %}
        {% endfor %}
        <p>Fichier CSV avec une colonne <code>email</code> (et optionnellement <code>nom</code>).
           Séparateur <code>;</code> ou <code>,</code>. Les doublons sont mis à jour (idempotent).</p>
        <form method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data">
            <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token('newsletter_import') }}">
            <input type="file" name="csv" accept=".csv,text/csv" required>
            <button type="submit">Importer</button>
        </form>
        <p style="margin-top:1rem; font-size:.85rem; color:#777;">
            Abonnés actuels : <strong>{{ count }}</strong> ·
            <a href="{{ path('admin_newsletter_export') }}">Exporter en CSV</a>
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
